<navigation-bar warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="全景看院演示" back="{{true}}" guardBack="{{true}}" fallbackUrl="{{story ? story.detailUrl : '/pages/showcase/index'}}"></navigation-bar>
<view class="story-shell" style="{{fontStyle}}"><text class="story-badge">演示空间 · 非真实机构实景</text><text class="story-title">{{story ? story.name : '环顾演示空间'}}</text><text class="story-muted">使用合成全景讲解看院方式，不代表该机构的真实环境或已核验 VR 资料。</text><block wx:if="{{allowed}}"><view class="story-viewport"><canvas wx:if="{{canvasVisible}}" id="panorama" type="webgl" class="story-panorama" catchtouchstart="touchStart" catchtouchmove="touchMove" catchtouchend="touchEnd" catchtouchcancel="touchEnd"></canvas></view><text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="story-muted">正在载入演示空间…</text><text wx:if="{{rendered}}" class="story-muted">左右 / 上下拖动环顾，双指缩放。</text><view class="story-actions"><button id="zoom-out" disabled="{{!rendered}}" bindtap="zoomOut">拉远</button><button id="zoom-in" disabled="{{!rendered}}" bindtap="zoomIn">拉近</button><button id="reset" disabled="{{!rendered}}" bindtap="resetView">回到初始视角</button></view><view class="story-actions"><button id="synthetic" disabled="{{loading || choosing}}" bindtap="useSample">{{rendered ? '重新载入演示空间' : '载入演示空间'}}</button></view></block><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="story-error" role="alert">{{error}}</text></view>
